WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:07.995
At TREC RAGTIME 2026, NP Labs turned multilingual
news into short English reports with citations.

00:00:08.195 --> 00:00:13.187
One topic asked how African penguin populations
changed and what could protect them.

00:00:13.567 --> 00:00:19.114
DeepSeek produced eight English queries. One looked
for conservation measures and fishing restrictions.

00:00:19.314 --> 00:00:25.351
The organizers’ search returned 100 hits per query
across English, Spanish, Russian, and Chinese.

00:00:25.731 --> 00:00:32.430
Mixedbread reranked the English article text. News24
rose from sixteenth to first for the fishing query.

00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:39.201
We selected 24 distinct articles across the ranked
lists and kept 19 extracted claims for this topic.

00:00:39.581 --> 00:00:47.709
The supported claims guided GPT-5.6 Sol. The report
cited News24 for a 2008 experiment.

00:00:47.909 --> 00:00:54.757
The study found that fishing restrictions slowed
annual population decline from about 7% to 5%.

00:00:55.137 --> 00:01:01.771
For this topic, AutoARGUE supported all 36 citations
and credited 10 of 16 reference nuggets.

00:01:01.971 --> 00:01:09.139
Selected articles contained all six missing details.
All six were absent from the candidates Nuggetizer
returned.

00:01:09.339 --> 00:01:16.209
News24 gave an estimate of 13,200 breeding pairs in
2019 that the report missed.

00:01:16.629 --> 00:01:23.989
Across 34 topics, preliminary AutoARGUE scored our
citation support at 95.73%.

00:01:24.189 --> 00:01:29.970
The report set covered 39.16% of reference nuggets
across those same topics.
